```mermaid
classDiagram
    %% Low-detail server-side classes for WebRTC processing
    class FastAPI_Signaling {
      +handle_offer(clientId, sdp)
      +handle_ice(clientId, candidate)
    }

    class aiortc_Peer {
      +setRemoteDescription(sdp)
      +createAnswer()
      +onTrack(track)
    }

    class MediaProcessor {
      +processAudio(frame)
      +processVideo(frame)
    }

    class EventBus {
      +publish(event)
      +subscribe(listener)
    }

    FastAPI_Signaling --> aiortc_Peer : negotiates
    aiortc_Peer --> MediaProcessor : delivers frames
    MediaProcessor --> EventBus : emits events

    note for MediaProcessor "ASR, VAD, CV pipelines (resampling,
feature extraction, detection)" 
```
